# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Get a key from https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys — usage is billed
# per request (a receipt scan is a few cents); there is no free tier.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars are inlined into the JS bundle at build time, which means
# this key ships inside the app and can be extracted from the IPA. Anthropic
# keys can't be locked to an iOS bundle ID, so create the key in a dedicated
# Claude Console workspace with a low monthly spend limit — that caps what a
# leaked copy can cost you. Rotate it if you ever publish the build widely.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
